=== meta
profile = "geml-style/v1"
title = "codemap style entry"
default-style = "style.geml"
===

This map's style entry point. `default-style` names the stylesheet every
document in this root uses. Seeded on first build; build never rewrites it.

To give some document a DIFFERENT stylesheet, add a `#sitemap` table here
(`| document | template |` rows). Resolution is two steps and no more: an
exact row wins, otherwise `default-style` — no glob, no cascade.
